    description: "",
    hideBio: true,
    statementLabel: "jurors' statement",
    statement: "“Between the realms of reality and fantasy exists a thin veil that suspends our belief and captures our attention by requiring us to find normalcy in the surreal.\n\nThe featured artists explore unique ways of masking and altering their forms so that they are neither fully one thing or another — making familiar objects and shapes feel distant. Their abstract configurations meld and mix to reveal the inter-reality that exists in that space between the possible and the absurd.”\n\n— Trinity Lester",
